
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Huntress.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Huntress.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"s0p8r8","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777002481306,"size":1898,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"s0p8r8"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Culture - The Huntress":[20,21],"#A highly-prized, female-exclusive profession of specialized trackers from Andrea's Cross.":[22,28],"#A highly-prized, female-exclusive profession of specialized trackers from Andrea's Cross.#{1}":[23,28]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["huntress","tracker","bounty hunter","walker family"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**What this is:** A female-exclusive tracking profession from Andrea's Cross. Huntresses are trained from birth in tracking, scouting, houndmastery, falconry, and leadership. The profession is matrilineal, usually passed mother-to-daughter/niece.\n\n**When to select:** When a character is a female tracker, bounty hunter, or mercenary from Andrea's Cross; when encountering a professional tracker or law enforcer in Andrea's Cross; when discussing prestigious female roles, elite hunting guilds, or family-run specialties in that region.\n\n**Key relationships:** Profession is matrilineal (House Walker is a famous wealthy line). Rare male apprentices exist (condemned). Employed as mercenaries, bounty hunters, or private retainers for nobles handling law enforcement and sport hunting."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Huntress.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1wi5ad7","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Huntress.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,18],"size":1017,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
